{{PROJECT_NAME}} — Licence overview

This repository is a **private parts library**. It stores files and records
about components that other companies design, make and sell. It is for
internal use by {{ORGANISATION}} only.

## Nothing here is under an open licence

No licence of ours covers anything in this repository. There is no CC BY-SA,
no GPL and no CERN Open Hardware Licence here. Do not publish, share or pass on
any file from it — not to the public, and not to contractors.

## Each file keeps its supplier's licence

Every file stays under the licence its supplier gave us, and only that licence.
The licence is recorded in three places, from the most specific to the least:

1. A `<file>.license` file next to one file, when that file has its own terms.
2. A `LICENSE` file in a family or brand folder, copied from the supplier.
3. The `license` field of the brand's or family's `okh.toml`, as an SPDX id or
   `LicenseRef-<name>`, and the address of the terms in `[brand] cad-terms`.

The most specific one wins.

## Terms in the part tables

A part row or a `vendor-index.csv` row marked `internal` is stored here and may
not be passed on to anyone. `fetch-only` rows are not stored; each person
downloads the file from the supplier. `redistributable` rows may be moved to a
public library.

## Trademarks

The {{ORGANISATION}} name and logo are trademarks. Brand names and part numbers
recorded in this repository are the trademarks of the companies that own them,
used here to identify their parts. See [`TRADEMARKS.md`](TRADEMARKS.md).
